/h10 [(1.2.5\240\240)(Just enter the king's move. The rook will tag along. for example, if you are white and you wish to castle king's side, enter: "e1-g1" You will see both your king and rook move. When SARGON castles, he lists it as 0-0 or 0-0-0 as in normal chess notation. To Capture En Passant)] D
